  "description": "Device Detection and User-Agent parser for Node.js. Detects the device, browser, operating system, and crawlers from HTTP headers such as the User-Agent and User-Agent Client Hints. Works on-premise with a data file or in the cloud. Built on the 51Degrees Pipeline API. An alternative to UAParser, DeviceAtlas, and WURFL.",
